17938480\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b45c/e619/582364_normal.png?m=1774620203\" alt=\"SeleiXi\" data-uid=\"582364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SeleiXi\">SeleiXi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 03:11:32 +08:00\">17h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以用 cursor ，有美国学生渠道的话去申请下学生认证可以一年免费</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938482\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e8b1/cbd0/1154_normal.png?m=1777997238\" alt=\"samt\" data-uid=\"1154\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/samt\">samt</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 03:31:06 +08:00\">17h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以看看我们的站，绝对满血，官方 1 折，max 号池直出的 token</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938524\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 07:26:11 +08:00\">13h 12m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/SeleiXi\">SeleiXi</a> #11 还可以学生认证呀，这个很难买到了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938552\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/acd6/85e6/497030_normal.png?m=1783483367\" alt=\"WaldenHorizon\" data-uid=\"497030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WaldenHorizon\">WaldenHorizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:10:14 +08:00\">12h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有攻击楼主的意思，opus 很聪明吧，改来改去没解决的问题，可能是在这里你也不确定用什么技术方案去实现，只描述了症状？<br>我觉得可以让它自述解决方案，你来具体指出问题所在，准确率会高不少，这可能是现阶段码农存在的最大价值吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938572\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/203a/7043/643093_normal.png?m=1704941203\" alt=\"zhongzhaoguo\" data-uid=\"643093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhongzhaoguo\">zhongzhaoguo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:25:18 +08:00\">12h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>建议自己充，因为中转站的计费，你想用用 Fable5 ，一天差不多要花掉 1000</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938586\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4e7301254e43636901dae3c071e739ca?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bwnjnOEI\" data-uid=\"545030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bwnjnOEI\">bwnjnOEI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:33:42 +08:00\">12h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在桌面端开 ultracode 能好不少 以及提示他让它以 ASD-STE100 的方式回复至少能读懂它的输出</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938636\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/72dd/4352/178974_normal.png?m=1769391179\" alt=\"hihihihihi\" data-uid=\"178974\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hihihihihi\">hihihihihi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:51:16 +08:00\">11h 47m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 factory droid 100 美金方案，合规很稳，但是 100 美金套餐，fable5 max 5 小时量也只抗几次交互</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938675\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0fe8/6033/154072_normal.png?m=1782427460\" alt=\"kulove\" data-uid=\"154072\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kulove\">kulove</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:03:03 +08:00\">11h 35m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>长期稳定就更应该考虑官方了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938820\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/17f7fedc8b917a71edf3f1e979de2eab?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hfzp\" data-uid=\"87050\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hfzp\">hfzp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:30:06 +08:00\">11h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>推荐 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://zairouter.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">zairouter.com</a> , 专注提供 gpt pro / claude max / grok heavy  , 模型保真, 不造假</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938896\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6f912d7ac2fc0aad112b61d4813a96d4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yarawen\" data-uid=\"611973\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yarawen\">yarawen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:41:33 +08:00\">10h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>官方 Copilot 可以用，需要 Pro+会员</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938993\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/232f/469a/405424_normal.png?m=1657529515\" alt=\"Tom7\" data-uid=\"405424\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tom7\">Tom7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:55:26 +08:00\">10h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>aHR0cHM6Ly9haWdjd3VqaS5jb20=，可以试试</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939004\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/grav