     \n                    <p>我现在用的中转需要吗 效果还可以的 需要加我 base64qq 我拉你进群:NzM0Njk2MTk5</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939319\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:39:32 +08:00\">9h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/WaldenHorizon\">WaldenHorizon</a> 所以大多数情况下，Fable5 并不好用。<br>但一些对数学要求高的活儿，比如上个月做一个 CA-SCL 译码器的特定硬件加速优化，核心代码，还只能靠 Fable5 搞定。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939394\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cb98ba7ca393ba597d83f771cf300eb7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hoythan\" data-uid=\"143072\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hoythan\">hoythan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:50:09 +08:00\">9h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用号池的基本上找不到真的，得找那种直接通过各种渠道采购官方 API 的的中转，唯一缺点就是贵。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939518\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4e30/8bb0/338826_normal.png?m=1711937958\" alt=\"allanwell\" data-uid=\"338826\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n